        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadima kumkopesha mghenyi kwa kuvara fwaida; eri BWANA Mlungu wako upate kukurasimia kwa maza rose kubonyagha andenyi ya isanga ijo kwawuyangia kujiwusa.",
          "type": "text",
