              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mkabonya ighemi kwa BWANA Mlungu onyu, msemuke luma kujilipa; kwa kukaia loli BWANA Mlungu onyu uchajilawia, na mkakaia luma, yadima iwuye kaung'a konyu.",
          "type": "text",
